  "instructions": [
    "Heat coconut oil in the copper pot over medium heat.",
    "Add the diced onions and cook until softened, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for an additional 1-2 minutes.",
    "Add the fermented red peppers, tomatoes, fermented jang, salt, and black pepper. Stir well.",
    "Reduce heat to low and simmer, covered, for 20-25 minutes or until the tagine thickens.",
    "Stir in the malted barley syrup to enhance the malty flavor.",
    "Taste and adjust seasoning as needed.",
    "Transfer the tagine to a serving dish and garnish with chopped parsley.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with additional parsley if desired."
